<script>
  // A wireframe of an app, and the parts of it that ship code to the browser: with brumate,
  // only the parts that respond to the user; with hydration, all of it. Two radio buttons and
  // :has switch the view, with no script.
</script>

<figure class="ships">
  <div class="ships-switch" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Which code ships">
    <label><input type="radio" name="ships" value="brumate" checked> brumate</label>
    <label><input type="radio" name="ships" value="hydration" class="ships-hydration"> Hydration</label>
  </div>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 720 460" role="img" aria-labelledby="ships-title ships-desc">
    <title id="ships-title">The code an app ships to the browser</title>
    <desc id="ships-desc">A wireframe of a shop: a header with a search field and a cart, a sidebar with a filter switch, a banner, tabs and three product cards with buttons, and a footer. With brumate, only the search field, the filter switch, the tabs and the buttons ship code, which comes with the page, and the cart badge updates. The rest ships as HTML only. With hydration, every part of the page ships its code and runs again in the browser.</desc>

    <rect x="10" y="10" width="700" height="440" rx="12" class="sm-frame"></rect>
    <line x1="10" y1="40" x2="710" y2="40" class="sm-rule"></line>
    <circle cx="30" cy="25" r="5" class="sm-dot"></circle>
    <circle cx="46" cy="25" r="5" class="sm-dot"></circle>
    <circle cx="62" cy="25" r="5" class="sm-dot"></circle>
    <rect x="90" y="17" width="260" height="16" rx="8" class="sm-dot"></rect>

    <g class="sm-static">
      <rect x="30" y="62" width="70" height="20" rx="4"></rect>
      <rect x="120" y="68" width="40" height="8" rx="4"></rect>
      <rect x="172" y="68" width="48" height="8" rx="4"></rect>
      <rect x="232" y="68" width="36" height="8" rx="4"></rect>

      <rect x="30" y="118" width="90" height="10" rx="4"></rect>
      <rect x="30" y="142" width="120" height="8" rx="4"></rect>
      <rect x="30" y="162" width="100" height="8" rx="4"></rect>
      <rect x="30" y="182" width="112" height="8" rx="4"></rect>
      <rect x="30" y="202" width="90" height="8" rx="4"></rect>
      <rect x="30" y="222" width="106" height="8" rx="4"></rect>
      <rect x="74" y="257" width="70" height="8" rx="4"></rect>

      <rect x="190" y="112" width="500" height="110" rx="8"></rect>

      <rect x="190" y="274" width="160" height="130" rx="8"></rect>
      <rect x="360" y="274" width="160" height="130" rx="8"></rect>
      <rect x="530" y="274" width="160" height="130" rx="8"></rect>

      <rect x="30" y="424" width="120" height="8" rx="4"></rect>
      <rect x="170" y="424" width="80" height="8" rx="4"></rect>
      <rect x="600" y="424" width="90" height="8" rx="4"></rect>
    </g>
    <g class="sm-static sm-deep">
      <rect x="214" y="140" width="220" height="16" rx="4"></rect>
      <rect x="214" y="166" width="300" height="8" rx="4"></rect>
      <rect x="214" y="182" width="260" height="8" rx="4"></rect>
      <rect x="200" y="284" width="140" height="60" rx="6"></rect>
